Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.77,0:00:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sigh. Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.29,0:00:27.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are...I mean...I am Peazzo, a Sister\Nin Training of the Church. How do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.87,0:00:30.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and this timid little thing\Nis my fellow sister in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.99,0:00:35.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,training i'm lino we heard\Nthere were intruders from
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.57,0:00:42.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the dark territory lurking\Nabout are you they huh i
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.35,0:00:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,think i'll let you handle\Nthis one they look annoying
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.21,0:00:53.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,um we are sort of we're\Nactually from the human
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.39,0:00:56.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,realm not the dark territory\NAs for intruding here,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.23,0:00:59.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we are. Technically.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.07,0:01:07.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Nell, do these two look\Nanything like monsters to you? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.07,0:01:09.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are their horns and tails?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.19,0:01:11.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how should I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.91,0:01:14.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just telling you what\Nthe books said they look like.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.59,0:01:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one jumping\Nto conclusions, Seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.11,0:01:20.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ladies? We'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.75,0:01:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If someone sees us, you'll get in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.13,0:01:31.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, there's no\Nchance of that happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.61,0:01:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This morning, the church\Nordered all the monks,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.73,0:01:37.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nuns, and apprentices to stay in\Ntheir quarters and lock their doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.29,0:01:40.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This was the perfect\Nopportunity for us to sneak
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.27,0:01:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out and have a look at\Nthese nasty intruders.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.09,0:01:49.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're human.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.53,0:01:50.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, very.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.55,0:01:56.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We heard you were arrested, but broke\Nyour spiritual chains and escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.37,0:01:59.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We also heard you defeated\Ntwo Integrity Knights!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.71,0:02:02.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I was sure you were\Nmonsters from the Dark Territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.77,0:02:04.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either that or Knights of Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.73,0:02:08.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you can understand why\Nwe were so curious about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.53,0:02:13.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One last thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.75,0:02:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you mind telling us\Nwhat your names are?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.61,0:02:21.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not at all. I'm Eugeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.63,0:02:23.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this here is Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.15,0:02:26.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you not have last names?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.21,0:02:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.12,0:02:30.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My family are settlers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.35,0:02:33.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And do you have last names? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.83,0:02:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been waiting to share them with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.25,0:02:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My full name, Sinner, is Lino Synthesis
