Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.69,0:04:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.60,0:04:27.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.63,0:04:32.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.73,0:04:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Beezel Synthesis 29.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.65,0:04:43.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.33,0:04:46.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,...tech -
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.89,0:04:56.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't fret, Eugeo, without a last name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.07,0:04:58.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're ours now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.17,0:05:07.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a paralysis poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.73,0:05:09.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want you to die yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.95,0:05:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not until we get you to\Nthe 50th floor anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.41,0:05:15.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you must be wondering.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.73,0:05:20.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How in the world did these two little\Ngirls become Integrity Knights?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.77,0:05:27.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were born and raised\Ninside the Central Cathedral.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.23,0:05:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One day, Administrator herself ordered\Nthe monks and nuns here to create us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.81,0:05:38.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She needed test subjects\Nfor a sacred arch she was
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.47,0:05:41.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,experimenting with that\Ncould resurrect the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.93,0:05:47.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We received our callings when we were\Nfive, earlier than other children.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.87,0:05:50.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our job was to kill each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.21,0:05:54.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were given little swords\Nthat looked like toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.29,0:05:57.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we'd peer off and take\Nturns stabbing each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.71,0:06:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At first, administrators' attempts at\Nresurrection were, how shall I say,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.21,0:06:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.01,0:06:38.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There were some children who exploded.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.63,0:06:42.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And others who ended up\Nas weird blobs of flesh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.71,0:06:45.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And still others who returned but were...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.05,0:06:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,different
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.31,0:06:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were being resurrected over and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.81,0:06:51.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we didn't like dying in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.63,0:06:54.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the two of us researched\Nhow to kill with one strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.73,0:06:58.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We found that if we killed\Ncleanly, it didn't hurt as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.27,0:07:01.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the odds of being successfully\Nresurrected were higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.61,0:07:07.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the problem was deciding\Nwhich strike worked the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.71,0:07:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We narrowed it down to lopping off\Nthe head or a quick stab to the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.19,0:07:15.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They both worked equally well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.65,0:07:18.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the end, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.11,0:07:23.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Administrator decided it was too difficult\Nto master the Sacred Art of Resurrection.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.65,0:07:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were about eight years old\Nwhen she abandoned the experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.97,0:07:30.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When it started, there were thirty of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.23,0:07:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Seal and i were the only survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.11,0:07:41.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, administrator made a special\Nexception and made us integrity knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.95,0:07:44.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, to a certain degree.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.09,0:07:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She said we hadn't learned enough to go\Non guard duty like the other knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.63,0:07:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we've been studying\Nthe laws and sacred arts
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.95,0:07:54.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with the other apprentices\Nfor the past two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.29,0:07:57.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be honest, we're tired of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.05,0:08:00.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Earlier today,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.37,0:08:04.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we were discussing ways to earn our\Ndragons and divine objects more quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.75,0:08:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We heard that minions from the Dark\NTerritory had infiltrated the Cathedral.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.83,0:08:14.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we thought, if we could capture and\Nexecute them before the other knights could,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.57,0:08:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it would show Administrator how capable we
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.91,0:08:19.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,were and she would make\Nus full-bledged knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.23,0:08:20.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, we waited on the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.49,0:08:26.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're truly sorry for using poison on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.37,0:08:28.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was our only option.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.97,0:08:32.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, we wanted to bring you to\Nthe 50th floor alive if possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.45,0:08:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and when we do get\Nthere, don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.89,0:08:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fiesel and I are really good at killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.33,0:08:40.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't hurt at all.
