Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.21,0:09:00.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well, if it isn't all\Nfour of the Whirling Blades.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.37,0:09:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As well as Vice Commander\NFanatio Synthesis, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.45,0:09:07.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole Senate must be in a panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.09,0:09:12.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why else would they ask you here,\NFanatio of the Heaven-Piercing Blade?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.75,0:09:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You apprentices should not be on the\Nbattlefield with honorable knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.47,0:09:20.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that is funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.29,0:09:23.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because you bring honor\Nand tradition into battle
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.39,0:09:26.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that you so-called mighty\Nintegrity knights lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.37,0:09:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not once but twice!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.95,0:09:29.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't you worry?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.95,0:09:31.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you can see,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.25,0:09:33.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we caught the intruders\Nand we'll make sure the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.93,0:09:36.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,reputation of the knights\Nwon't be sullied any further!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.53,0:09:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can count on that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.33,0:09:39.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.51,0:09:42.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to decapitate\Nthese intruders now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.73,0:09:47.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So watch closely and make sure to give\Nan accurate report to the Pontifex!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.29,0:09:50.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are honorable knights, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.79,0:09:52.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We trust you not to steal our...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.07,0:09:55.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For credit, that would be cowardly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.19,0:10:04.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No fair...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.41,0:10:06.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.53,0:10:31.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll wear off in a minute\Nas soon as you can move.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.29,0:10:34.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your lips again recite\Nyour perfect weapon art.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.19,0:10:36.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But keep it down this ain't\Ngonna work if the night's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.07,0:10:41.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When it's ready to go hang on\Nto it a bit wait for my signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.05,0:10:50.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're wondering\Nhow in the world can i move.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.03,0:10:56.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gave yourselves away.\NYou said, all the monks
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.91,0:10:59.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nuns and apprentices were\Nordered to stay in their.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.59,0:11:02.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rooms and if you're a\Nmonk nun or apprentice
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.87,0:11:05.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no way you'd\Ndisobey the church's order.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.37,0:11:08.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you weren't in your\Nrooms you were looking
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.69,0:11:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for us so that meant\Nyou guys weren't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.07,0:11:15.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apprentices i also noticed\Nthose scabbards you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.07,0:11:18.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,got are made of ruby oak\Nthey use that wood to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.75,0:11:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hold swords made of\Ntoxic rubaril steel. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.41,0:11:24.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because it's the only thing that
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.53,0:11:25.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,won't rot against the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.77,0:11:28.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way you'd have\Nsomething like that if you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.17,0:11:30.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,were sisters in training.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.29,0:11:33.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I started reciting\Na poison-neutralizing
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.07,0:11:35.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,art before you got near us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.71,0:11:38.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It took a while to kick\Nin, but what can you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.65,0:11:42.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's more to strength\Nthan being fast with a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.21,0:11:57.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I won't kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.53,0:11:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to teach you a lesson today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.23,0:12:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to watch\Nthese knights you made fun
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.39,0:12:05.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of fight and see what\Nreal strength's all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.09,0:12:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the wait,\NVice Commander Fanatio.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.67,0:12:25.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's Kirito, the Swordsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.13,0:12:47.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you do battle\Nwith a vice commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.97,0:12:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Four Whirling Blades\Nare your opponents here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.05,0:12:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turn and face us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.05,0:12:54.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold your position.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.05,0:12:57.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.99,0:12:59.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.47,0:13:06.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System call.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.07,0:13:09.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enhance armament!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.69,0:13:24.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.59,0:13:56.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My voice is back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.73,0:13:58.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System call.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.99,0:14:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Criminal or no, if you lived in Senator,\Nyou should know what a mirror is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.63,0:14:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is an instrument capable of\Nreflecting Solas's light completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.19,0:14:26.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Long ago, the Pontifex gathered\N1,000 enormous mirrors.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.61,0:14:31.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To focus Solas's midsummer light,\Ncreating a pure white flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.73,0:14:37.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was so hot, it melted a\Nhuman-sized boulder within minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.47,0:14:41.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Pontifex, using her holy skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.89,0:14:48.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fused the 1,000 mirrors together, then\Nhoned them to create a magnificent sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.89,0:14:58.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This sword, the heaven-piercing blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.39,0:15:00.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know this,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.99,0:15:06.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your stomach and foot were punctured by\Nthe glorious power of the sun god Solus.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.83,0:15:09.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It reflects the sun's energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.89,0:15:15.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, sinner, prepare to meet your end.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.37,0:15:19.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.81,0:15:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.59,0:15:47.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your eyes are laced with disdain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.23,0:15:49.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like his.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.79,0:15:54.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You men think my gender affects\Nthe quality of my skill?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.85,0:15:57.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even sinners deny me respect!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.25,0:15:59.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I command you to fight me in earnest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.19,0:16:04.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.85,0:16:06.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An integrity knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.69,0:16:13.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.09,0:16:15.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your sword and skill, it's a cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.21,0:16:20.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It let you stand back and fire shots\Nand hide the fact you're a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.49,0:16:23.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ain't that right, Lady Fanatio?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.65,0:16:25.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.19,0:16:27.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just so you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.67,0:16:31.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the reason I looked so shocked before,\Nit wasn't because you're a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.89,0:16:35.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because when you lost your\Nhelmet, you lost all your nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.49,0:16:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know why you hide your\Nface under that helmet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.71,0:16:43.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anyone here's got a problem\Nwith you being a woman, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.47,0:16:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.69,0:16:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wretch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.73,0:16:47.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.07,0:16:49.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to try? Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.07,0:16:54.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what it's like to fight and\Nlose to women, and you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.33,0:16:57.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never held back for\Nthem, and I won't for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.37,0:17:24.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.47,0:17:42.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.43,0:17:45.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are different.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.09,0:17:47.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although you may be a sinner,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.47,0:17:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you are quite unlike the other\Nmen I have fought before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.65,0:17:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of them had your spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.51,0:17:57.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their attacks all lacked conviction\Nonce they saw my detestable face.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.87,0:18:00.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Detestable? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.61,0:18:04.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, how come you comb your hair and\Nput on lipstick if you wear a helmet?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.95,0:18:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't do it for\Nyourself, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.61,0:18:19.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're bitter because you can't have\Nthe person you love, and you know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.23,0:18:22.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because the Church and\Nthe Pontifect say you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.09,0:18:26.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm here to destroy them and\Nfree everyone from their tyranny!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.73,0:18:30.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can tell you are no agent of\Ndarkness, as the Prime Minister claimed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.91,0:18:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Regardless, you are still\Nextremely dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.97,0:18:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You would disrupt the Church and the\NKnighthood, not just with your sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.43,0:18:40.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but with your words.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.57,0:18:45.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You also put the human empire\Nin peril, and that, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.93,0:18:47.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is a knight's duty to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.57,0:18:49.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You speak the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.27,0:18:55.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I am obliged to defeat you, even\Nif it sullies my pride as a knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.91,0:19:00.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hidden light of the heaven-piercing\Nblade, cast off your shackles.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.75,0:19:03.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Release recollection!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.17,0:19:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.57,0:19:32.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna kill us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.57,0:19:37.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's my chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.55,0:19:39.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My only chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.67,0:19:42.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enhanced Armament!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.43,0:19:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blue Rose Bloom!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.97,0:19:57.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn that rat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.25,0:20:11.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito, are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.21,0:20:12.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't move. I'll heal you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.55,0:20:13.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.33,0:20:16.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let up. Keep at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.29,0:20:18.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.39,0:20:21.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ain't enough to stop her?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.85,0:20:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System call!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.55,0:20:41.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You knights, you're all the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.55,0:20:44.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all heartless!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.67,0:20:56.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.55,0:20:57.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop or die!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.87,0:21:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.91,0:21:10.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.65,0:21:12.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't beat her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.65,0:21:16.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're letting hate get\Nthe better of you, Eugeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.49,0:21:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.25,0:21:24.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't come this far because you\Nhated the Integrity Knights, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.31,0:21:27.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're here to get Alice back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.03,0:21:29.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're here because you love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.13,0:21:31.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.63,0:21:35.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Integrity Knight, she feels\Njust as strong about her duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.07,0:21:37.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm no different.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.43,0:21:39.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to protect everyone in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.75,0:21:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.87,0:21:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.23,0:21:48.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even this night, we're so close,\Nand we can't afford to give up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.59,0:21:53.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ain't that right, Eugeo?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.39,0:22:03.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enhance Armament!
